 from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025 that same pair ran 76% of normal on the middle, while June to July ran 207%. Every grid had its driest year in 1988, with grid 26246 lowest at 57%.</p>"}
